    "⚡Won't charge my device? - Let's see if we can fix this quickly.  · Try another cable/ output port  · Try a new device and share your device's model with us  · Make sure the power bank has enough power": "⚡Ní luchtaíonn mo ghléas? – Féachaimis an féidir linn é seo a réiteach go tapa. · Bain triail as cábla / port aschuir eile · Bain triail as gléas nua agus roinn samhail do ghléis linn · Cinntigh go bhfuil go leor cumhachta sa bhanc cumhachta",
    "⚡Won't recharge? - Let's see if we can fix this quickly.  · Make sure you're using the correct input port  · Try a different charging cable, 18W or higher wall charger, power outlet  · Leave the power bank charging for at least 30 minutes, then check the battery indicator again": "⚡Ní athluchtaíonn? – Féachaimis an féidir linn é seo a réiteach go tapa. · Cinntigh go bhfuil tú ag úsáid an phort ionchuir cheart · Bain triail as cábla luchtaithe eile, luchtaire balla 18W nó níos airde, asraon cumhachta · Fág an banc cumhachta ag luchtú ar feadh 30 nóiméad ar a laghad, ansin seiceáil an táscaire ceallraí arís",
    "⚡Slow charge? - Let's see if we can fix this quickly.💡 A Quick Note on Charging SpeedsUnder the same charging protocol, your charging speed is decided by the device with the lowest max speed.For example, if your phone supports 20W and your power bank supports 45W, your phone will charge at 20W to protect its battery.1. If the power bank cannot fast charge a phone: 1) Try another cable and USB output port2) Estimated Charging Time (hours) ≈ (Battery Capacity (mAh) ÷ 1000 × 3.85V) ÷ Charging Power (W) + 0.5 hoursExample: An iPhone 12 has a battery capacity of 2,815 mAh and supports up to 20W wired charging. Even when using a 45W power bank, the phone can only charge at up to 20W.Estimated charging time: 2,815 ÷ 1,000 × 3.85 ÷ 20 + 0.5 ≈ 1 hourNotes:① 3.85V = Typical voltage of a smartphone battery② Charging Power (W) = The maximum charging power supported by your phone③ Actual charging time may vary depending on the phone, cable, battery level, temperature, and other charging conditions1. If the power bank itself cannot be fast charged:1) Use a 18W or higher adapter and another cable to recharge it again2) Estimated Recharging Time(hour) ≈ Charging Time (hours) ≈ Power Bank Energy (Wh) ÷ (Adapter Power (W) × 80%) + 0.5 hoursExample: for a 10,000mAh (37Wh) power bank using an 18W adapter: 37Wh ÷ (18W × 80%) + 0.5 ≈ 3 hoursNotes:① Wh (Watt-hours) = The total energy capacity of the power bank② 80% = An estimated charging efficiency. Some energy is lost during the charging process③ Actual charging time may vary depending on the adapter, cable, power bank, temperature, and other charging conditions": "⚡Luchtú mall? – Féachaimis an féidir linn é seo a réiteach go tapa.💡 Nóta Gasta ar Luasanna LuchtaitheFaoin bprótacal luchtaithe céanna, socraítear do luas luchtaithe ag an ngléas leis an luas uasta is ísle.Mar shampla, má thacaíonn do ghuthán le 20W agus do bhanc cumhachta le 45W, luchtóidh do ghuthán ag 20W chun a cheallra a chosaint.1. Mura féidir leis an mbanc cumhachta guthán a luchtú go tapa: 1) Bain triail as cábla agus port USB eile2) Am Luchtaithe Measta (uaireanta) ≈ (Toilleadh Ceallraí (mAh) ÷ 1000 × 3,85V) ÷ Cumhacht Luchtaithe (W) + 0.5 uairSampla: Tá toilleadh 2,815 mAh ag iPhone 12 agus tacaíonn sé le suas le 20W luchtaithe sreinge. Fiú le banc cumhachta 45W, ní fhéadfaidh an guthán luchtú ach ag 20W.Am measta: 2,815 ÷ 1,000 × 3.85 ÷ 20 + 0.5 ≈ 1 uairNótaí:① 3.85V = Gnáthvoltas ceallraí fóin chliste② Cumhacht Luchtaithe (W) = An chumhacht luchtaithe uasta a thacaíonn do ghuthán léi③ Féadfaidh an t-am iarbhír a bheith éagsúil ag brath ar ghuthán, cábla, leibhéal ceallraí, teocht, etc.1. Mura féidir an banc cumhachta féin a luchtú go tapa:1) Úsáid cuibheoir 18W+ agus cábla eile chun é a athluchtú2) Am Athluchtaithe Measta (uaireanta) ≈ Fuinneamh (Wh) ÷ (Cumhacht Cuibheora (W) × 80%) + 0.5 uairSampla: banc cumhachta 10,000mAh (37Wh) le cuibheoir 18W: 37Wh ÷ (18W × 80%) + 0.5 ≈ 3 uairNótaí:① Wh = Toilleadh fuinnimh iomlán an bhainc chumhachta② 80% = Éifeachtúlacht luchtaithe mheasta. Cailltear roinnt fuinnimh le linn an phróisis③ Féadfaidh an t-am iarbhír a bheith éagsúil",
